    {
      "number": 23,
      "category": "",
      "title": "王勱（南史字公齊）",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-023-wangmai:p006",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "及蕭勃平，以勱為廣州刺史。未行，改為衡州刺史。王琳據有上流，衡、廣攜貳，勱不得之鎮，留於大庾嶺。",
